<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Completion on Ricky</title><link>https://linzeyan.github.io/zh-tw/tags/completion/</link><description>Recent content in Completion on Ricky</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-tw</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 10 Dec 2021 17:44:49 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://linzeyan.github.io/zh-tw/tags/completion/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Zsh tab 補完無法使用</title><link>https://linzeyan.github.io/zh-tw/posts/2021/20211210-zsh-tab-completion-not-working/</link><pubDate>Fri, 10 Dec 2021 17:44:49 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://linzeyan.github.io/zh-tw/posts/2021/20211210-zsh-tab-completion-not-working/</guid><description>&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://stackoverflow.com/questions/46939906/zsh-tab-completion-not-working" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Zsh tab 補完無法使用&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 id="問題"&gt;問題&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;雖然我之前用過 Oh-My-Zsh，但這次（設定新電腦）我決定盡量不要安裝它，讓環境更精簡。現在我想單獨取用 Oh-My-Zsh 的大小寫不敏感補完功能。翻查原始碼後，我找到下面這行：
&lt;code&gt;zstyle ':completion:*' matcher-list 'm:{a-zA-Z}={A-Za-z}' 'r:|=*' 'l:|=* r:|=*'&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;我相當確定 Oh-My-Zsh 就是用這行達成我的需求，所以我把它加進 &lt;code&gt;.zshrc&lt;/code&gt;。重啟終端機後輸入 &lt;code&gt;cd desk&lt;/code&gt;，再按 [tab]，結果沒有作用，並沒有補完成 &lt;code&gt;cd Desktop/&lt;/code&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;以下是完整的 &lt;code&gt;.zshrc&lt;/code&gt; 供參考：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block" data-code-block&gt;&lt;div class="code-block-full" id="code-block-98bd2a6fec7f980ff9290b02086cbae6-0"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Source - https://stackoverflow.com/q&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Posted by kylemart&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Retrieved 2026-01-05, License - CC BY-SA 3.0&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# pure shell theme&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;autoload -U promptinit&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt; promptinit
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;prompt pure
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# completion definitions&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;zstyle &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;:completion:*&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt; matcher-list &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;m:{a-zA-Z}={A-Za-z}&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;r:|=*&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;l:|=* r:|=*&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nv"&gt;fpath&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=(&lt;/span&gt;/usr/local/share/zsh-completions &lt;span class="nv"&gt;$fpath&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# syntax highlighting (must be last line)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;source&lt;/span&gt; /usr/local/share/zsh-syntax-highlighting/zsh-syntax-highlighting.zsh
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;script type="application/json" class="code-block-data"&gt;{"copyButton":true,"expanded":false,"labels":{"code":"Code","copied":"Copied!","copy":"Copy","copyError":"Copy failed. Try again.","showAll":"Show all {count} lines","showLess":"Show fewer lines"},"language":"","preview":"","source":"# Source - https://stackoverflow.com/q\n# Posted by kylemart\n# Retrieved 2026-01-05, License - CC BY-SA 3.0\n\n# pure shell theme\nautoload -U promptinit; promptinit\nprompt pure\n\n# completion definitions\nzstyle ':completion:*' matcher-list 'm:{a-zA-Z}={A-Za-z}' 'r:|=*' 'l:|=* r:|=*'\nfpath=(/usr/local/share/zsh-completions $fpath)\n\n# syntax highlighting (must be last line)\nsource /usr/local/share/zsh-syntax-highlighting/zsh-syntax-highlighting.zsh\n","title":"bash"}&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4 id="答案"&gt;答案&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;只要 &lt;code&gt;autoload&lt;/code&gt; 並執行 &lt;code&gt;compinit&lt;/code&gt; 即可。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>